    "A bounded, warm local run with 20/50 virtual workflow clients, not 10,000 simultaneous users or active restaurants.",
    "The 10,000 restaurants, 200,000 menu items, 50,000 historical browse orders and 20,000 ratings are synthetic. Historical orders have no financial ledger and are excluded from new-order invariant counts.",
